Description

 Designed and implemented the primary navigation system and responsive website layout for the Pharma Store. This implementation focused on providing a clean, user-friendly, and mobile-responsive navigation experience, enabling customers to easily browse medicine categories, healthcare services, subscriptions, prescriptions, and AI healthcare features across all devices.

Business Requirement

 The Pharma Store website required an intuitive navigation system that allows users to quickly access products and healthcare services while maintaining a consistent experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

The navigation layout needed to support future expansion, improve usability, and provide easy access to all major pharmacy modules.

